{
  "id": "uis-gtvp-5-v",
  "title": "Share of short-cycle tertiary students in vocational programmes (UIS)",
  "description": "Students enrolled in vocational programmes at short-cycle tertiary level (ISCED 5) as a percentage of all short-cycle tertiary students, both sexes.",
  "unit": "%",
  "topic": "Participation",
  "source_label": "GTVP.5.V",
  "comparability": "For EU, EFTA and OECD countries these figures come from the same joint UNESCO-OECD-Eurostat (UOE) collection as Eurostat's education statistics; UIS adds candidate countries. 'Vocational' includes school-based as well as work-based (apprenticeship-type) programmes, so this measures the weight of VET, not of apprenticeship. Many countries have no short-cycle tertiary level or report it only from 2011 (ISCED 2011).",
